4.3 Bot Interactive Flow


* Receipt & Acknowledgment: Merchant sends a voice note (e.g., "Bill Sarah 120 XLM for graphic design work").
* Processing State: The bot replies immediately with a Telegram chat action indicator (record_voice / typing).
* Review Card: The bot renders a confirmation card using Telegram Inline Keyboards displaying amount, description, and recipient with action buttons ([Confirm & Generate Link], [Edit], [Cancel]).
* Execution: Upon confirmation, Celery provisions the Invoice record with a unique memo/M-address and returns a deep-link, Telegram WebApp Mini-App button, and dynamic QR code.
Real-Time Settlement Alert: When payment is confirmed on the Stellar network, the bot delivers an instant push notification containing full transaction metadata.


5. Embeddable Widget & Live Stream System


5.1 Web Component / iFrame Engine


* Lightweight Script Injection: Merchants integrate WigglePay via a single script tag:
<script src="https://cdn.wigglepay.io/widget.js" 
        data-wiggle-key="pub_live_79a8bc123" 
        data-amount="25" 
        data-asset="USDC" 
        data-memo="Donation" 
        data-theme="system"></script>
* Modal vs. Inline Architecture: Generates an encapsulated Shadow DOM or secure sandboxed iframe to prevent CSS style leaking and protect against script injection vulnerabilities.
Web3 Wallet Bridge: Interfaces with popular Stellar browser extensions (Freighter, Albedo, xBull) via @stellar/freighter-api for one-click payment signing.


5.2 Real-Time Live Stream Overlay (OBS Engine)


* Overlay Route: https://wigglepay.io/overlay/{overlay_token} explicitly styled and optimized for OBS Browser Sources.
* WebSocket Connection: Connects directly to Django Channels at wss://api.wigglepay.io/ws/overlays/{overlay_token}/.
Trigger Pipeline: When a payment is settled, Channels broadcasts payload parameters (e.g., amount, asset, donor, message) to invoke on-screen animations and Text-To-Speech audio.


